  "prose": [
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "在方程 $(3-14)$ 中含有一个气体普适恒量 $R$ 和阿伏伽德罗常数 $N_A$ 的比值。\n对于所有物质来说，这个比值都是相同的。\n为了对奥地利学者、分子运动论奠基者之一的玻尔兹曼表示尊敬，把这个比值叫做玻尔兹曼恒量。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 76,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0085#3"
      ],
      "source_text": "在方程 $(3-14)$ 中含有一个气体普适恒量 $R$ 和阿伏伽德罗常数 $N_A$ 的比值。对于所有物质来说，这个比值都是相同的。为了对奥地利学者、分子运动论奠基者之一的玻尔兹曼表示尊敬，把这个比值叫做玻尔兹曼恒量。",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "玻尔兹曼恒量等于",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 76,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0085#4"
      ],
      "source_text": "玻尔兹曼恒量等于",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$k=\\frac{R}{N_A}=\\frac{8.31\\frac{\\text{焦耳}}{\\text{开}\\cdot\\text{摩尔}}}{6.02\\times10^{23}\\frac{1}{\\text{摩尔}}}$ $=1.38\\times10^{-23}$ 焦耳/开。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 76,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0085#5"
      ],
      "source_text": "$k=\\frac{R}{N_A}=\\frac{8.31\\frac{\\text{焦耳}}{\\text{开}\\cdot\\text{摩尔}}}{6.02\\times10^{23}\\frac{1}{\\text{摩尔}}}$ $=1.38\\times10^{-23}$ 焦耳/开。",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "考虑到玻尔兹曼恒量，方程 $(3-14)$ 可写成",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 76,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0085#6"
      ],
      "source_text": "考虑到玻尔兹曼恒量，方程 $(3-14)$ 可写成",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$\\overline E=\\frac{3}{2}kT.$\n$(3-15)$",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 76,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0085#7"
      ],
      "source_text": "$\\overline E=\\frac{3}{2}kT.$　$(3-15)$",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "fig",
      "text": "",
